<div class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Confirm before sending</p><h1>Review <?= e($payload['name']?:'campaign') ?></h1><p class="muted">Check the ordered message sequence and projected usage. Nothing is queued until you confirm.</p></div>
<div class="two-col"><section class="panel"><h2>Message sequence</h2><p class="muted">Template: <strong><?= e($template['name']) ?></strong><?php if($template['provider_template_name']): ?> · Provider template: <?= e($template['provider_template_name']) ?><?php endif; ?></p><ol class="sequence-list"><?php foreach($template['parts'] as $part): ?><li><span class="step-number"><?= (int)$part['sequence'] ?></span><div><strong><?= e(ucfirst($part['type'])) ?></strong><?php if($part['type']==='text'): ?><p class="preview-text"><?= nl2br(e((string)$part['text'])) ?></p><?php else: ?><p class="muted">Media #<?= (int)$part['media_id'] ?><?= $part['caption']?' · '.e($part['caption']):'' ?></p><?php endif; ?></div></li><?php endforeach; ?></ol>
<div class="notice notice-warning"><strong>Messaging window.</strong> Business-initiated sends must comply with WhatsApp's provider rules and the recipient's messaging-window state. Your delivery adapter is responsible for final provider enforcement. Suppressed and ineligible contacts are excluded again immediately before queueing and dispatch.</div></section>
<aside class="panel confirm-summary"><h2>Projected usage</h2><dl class="summary-list"><div><dt>Eligible, deduplicated recipients</dt><dd><?= number_format($eligible) ?></dd></div><div><dt>Ordered parts per recipient</dt><dd><?= number_format($parts) ?></dd></div><div class="summary-total"><dt>Projected message parts</dt><dd><?= number_format($projected) ?></dd></div><div><dt>Already reserved today</dt><dd><?= number_format($used) ?></dd></div><div><dt>Your daily limit</dt><dd><?= number_format($limit) ?></dd></div></dl>
<p class="hint"><strong>How this is counted:</strong> each recipient receives <?= (int)$parts ?> part<?= $parts===1?'':'s' ?>; every recipient-and-part combination is one send. <?= number_format($eligible) ?> × <?= (int)$parts ?> = <strong><?= number_format($projected) ?></strong> reserved parts. <?= (int)$excluded ?> selected or grouped contacts are excluded because they are suppressed, lack consent, or are ineligible.</p>
<?php if($projected+$used>$limit): ?><div class="alert alert-error" role="alert">This campaign exceeds your available daily allowance. Reduce the audience or ask an administrator for a higher limit.</div><?php endif; ?>
<form method="post" action="<?= e(url('campaigns/create')) ?>" class="stack"><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="confirmed" value="1"><input type="hidden" name="name" value="<?= e($payload['name']) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="template_id" value="<?= (int)$payload['template_id'] ?>"><?php foreach($payload['contact_ids'] as $id): ?><input type="hidden" name="contact_ids[]" value="<?= (int)$id ?>"><?php endforeach; ?><?php foreach($payload['group_ids'] as $id): ?><input type="hidden" name="group_ids[]" value="<?= (int)$id ?>"><?php endforeach; ?>
